# Test fixtures need their pre-baked state file + embeddings checked in so
# StateFileBackend has data to serve on a fresh CI checkout. Re-include the
# directory and its contents.
!crates/deslop-mcp/tests/fixtures/csharp-mcp/.deslop-cache/
!crates/deslop-mcp/tests/fixtures/csharp-mcp/.deslop-cache/**

# typeDiagram-generated IPC model code (source of truth: docs/models/*.td).
# Per CLAUDE.md the generated wire types must NOT be committed; they are
# regenerated on every cargo build by `crates/deslop-core/build.rs` and
# on every `make vsix-build` via the `typediagram-gen` Makefile target.
crates/deslop-core/src/wire_generated.rs
clients/vscode/src/types/wire-generated.ts


*.vsix


.ghissues/
clients/vscode/bin/

